The implementation assumes an external service to provide session IDs, timestamps, and metadata, as well as a cleanup function to handle expired or otherwise invalid connections. Additionally, the BATCH_SIZE, MAX_MEMORY, and MAX_TIME are configurable parameters for optimizing performance under various constraints.']

